ABA</term><def><p id="Par34">Gamma-aminobutyric acid</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>GF</term><def><p id="Par35">Germ-free</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>GLUTs</term><def><p id="Par36">Glucose transporters</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>GSH</term><def><p id="Par37">Glutathione</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>GWAS</term><def><p id="Par38">Genome-wide association studies</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>HDACs</term><def><p id="Par39">Histone deacetylases</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>HLA-DRB5-DRB1</term><def><p id="Par40">Human leukocyte antigen DRB5-DRB1</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>IL</term><def><p id="Par41">Interleukin</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>IPYA</term><def><p id="Par42">Indole-3-pyruvic acid</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>LOAD</term><def><p id="Par43">Late-onset Alzheimer&#x02019;s disease</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>LOX</term><def><p id="Par44">Lipoxygenase</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>LPS</term><def><p id="Par45">Lipopolysaccharide</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>LRP</term><def><p id="Par46">LDL receptor-related protein</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>MChTs</term><def><p id="Par47">Medium-chain triglycerides</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>MCI</term><def><p id="Par48">Mild cognitive impairment</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>MCTs</term><def><p id="Par49">Monocarboxylate transporters</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>MeD</term><def><p id="Par50">Mediterranean diet</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>MMSE</term><def><p id="Par51">Mini-mental state examination</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>MS4A</term><def><p id="Par52">Membrane-spanning 4-domain subfamily A</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>NFTs</term><def><p id="Par53">Neurofibrillary tangles</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>NMDA</term><def><p id="Par54">N-methyl-D-aspartate</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>NME8</term><def><p id="Par55">NME/NM23 family member 8</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>NSAIDs</term><def><